   "unit": "lintner",
   "read": "The 17 bulletins this catalogue already cites were re-read. Four print \"Diastatic Power (Lintner)\" and \"Alpha Amylase\"; the other thirteen — the caramel and roasted range — print no diastatic power row at all. Carapils is the one that says so in words: \"Devoid of enzymes and can be steeped in hot water or mashed\"."
  },
